{"id":"werk","lemma":"Werk","pos":"noun","rank":1801,"glosses":["work, achievement (the result of working)","work, piece (of art, literature, or the like)","factory, plant, works"],"ipa":"/vɛʁk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ce/De-Werk.ogg/De-Werk.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Werkes","plural":"Werke"},"formAudio":{"Werkes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Werkes.wav","Werke":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Werke.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich las eines seiner Werke.","en":"I read one of his works.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to read","l":"lesen"},{"g":"a, an","l":"ein"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Mach dich einfach ans Werk!","en":"Just get to work.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392911","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"easy"},null,null]},{"text":"Machen wir uns ans Werk!","en":"Let's get to work.","words":[{"g":"to make"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null,null]},{"text":"Gehe vorsichtig zu Werke!","en":"Use caution.","words":[{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"carefully"},{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Die Arbeiter waren stolz auf ihr Werk.","en":"The workers were proud of their work.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"to work","l":"arbeiten"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"proud"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null]}]}